        "headline": "PRT Proposes Final Bus Line Refresh Network in Allegheny County",
        "summary": "Pittsburgh Regional Transit (PRT) has detailed a proposed final Bus Line Refresh network designed to enhance transit reliability, service frequency, and seven-day service across Allegheny County. The PRT Board is anticipated to vote on the plan in November 2026, with service changes targeted for implementation in the second half of 2027 if approved.",
