          },
          {
            "quote": "Below you'll find a summary of the steps toward implementing the Bus Line Refresh service changes across Allegheny County."
          },
          {
            "quote": "Following the public comment period, the board will formally review the plan and the public testimony ahead of an anticipated vote in November 2026."
          },
          {
